[statement]
A package the request's packages displace, which a package removed also
needed, goes with that removal, not at its successor's turn: `y`, which
the request forbids, needs `ide`, and `idf` takes `id` from it; apk
removes `ide` right after `y`.

[repository]
P:ide
V:1
p:id=78

P:idf
V:1
p:id=78

P:app
V:1
D:a b idf

P:a
V:1

P:b
V:1

[installed]
P:old
V:1

P:ide
V:1
p:id=78

P:y
V:1
D:ide

[world]
y

[request]
app
!y

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove old 1
remove y 1
remove ide 1
install a 1
install b 1
install idf 1
install app 1
